sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Diagramme d'Interaction des Classes Internes : Community & Peer-Review Service

    participant Ctrl as CommunityController
    participant Svc as CommunityService
    participant AuthClient as AuthRestClient
    participant ThreadRepo as ForumThreadRepository
    participant ThreadEnt as ForumThread (Entity)
    participant PeerRepo as PeerReviewRepository
    participant CodeConsumer as CodePassedConsumer
    participant EventPub as RabbitMQEventPublisher

    Note over Ctrl,ThreadRepo: Scénario 1 : Consultation Thread (Enrichissement Synchrone REST)
    Ctrl->>Svc: getThreadDetails(threadId)
    Svc->>ThreadRepo: findById(threadId)
    ThreadRepo-->>Svc: forumThread
    Svc->>AuthClient: getUserSummary(forumThread.authorId) [REST Synchrone]
    AuthClient-->>Svc: UserSummaryDto(fullName="Sarah B.", avatarUrl="...")
    Svc-->>Ctrl: ThreadDetailsDto(thread, authorInfo)

    Note over CodeConsumer,PeerRepo: Scénario 2 : Déblocage Peer-Review (Consommation Asynchrone)
    CodeConsumer->>Svc: handleCodeSolutionPassed(CodeSolutionPassedEvent)
    Svc->>PeerRepo: unlockPeerReviewAccess(userId, exerciseId)

    Note over Ctrl,EventPub: Scénario 3 : Signalement d'Abus (Publication Asynchrone)
    Ctrl->>Svc: reportAbuse(targetUserId, reason)
    Svc->>EventPub: publishUserReportedAbuseEvent(targetUserId, reason) [RabbitMQ]
    Svc-->>Ctrl: ReportConfirmationDto
